<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{statusCode}} — HTTP 305</title>
    <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#153a59">
    <style>
        *,
        *::before,
        *::after {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --bg: #153a59;
            --surface: #1b4568;
            --surface-hover: #1f5078;
            --border: #265a80;
            --border-focus: #f0508a;
            --accent: #f0508a;
            --accent-hover: #d94478;
            --text: #efeff1;
            --text-muted: #8eafc4;
            --radius: 12px;
            --glow: 0 0 20px rgba(240, 80, 138, 0.15);
            --warn: #f0a050;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        body::before {
            content: "";
            position: fixed;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            width: 600px;
            height: 600px;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(240, 80, 138, 0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .card {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 520px;
            padding: 40px 36px 36px;
            margin: 20px;
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .logo h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .logo h1 span {
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .error-code {
            font-size: 96px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--warn);
            margin: 24px 0 8px;
            line-height: 1;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            opacity: 0.85;
        }

        .tagline {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 0 0 16px;
        }

        .message {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0 0 20px;
            max-width: 420px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .upstream-url {
            display: block;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            background: var(--bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 10px 14px;
            margin: 0 auto 24px;
            max-width: 420px;
            word-break: break-all;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .upstream-url .label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 11px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            color: var(--warn);
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--warn);
            background: rgba(240, 160, 80, 0.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(240, 160, 80, 0.3);
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        .home-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 32px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #fff;
            background: var(--accent);
            border: none;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.2s;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        .home-btn:hover {
            background: var(--accent-hover);
            box-shadow: var(--glow);
        }

        .home-btn:active {
            transform: scale(0.98);
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 24px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .card {
                padding: 28px 20px 24px;
                margin: 12px;
            }

            .logo h1 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }

            .error-code {
                font-size: 72px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="logo">
            <h1>HTTP <span>305</span></h1>
        </div>

        <div class="error-code">{{statusCode}}</div>
        <p class="tagline">{{statusText}}</p>
        <span class="badge">Upstream Error</span>
        <p class="message">
            This error came from the website you're trying to visit &mdash; not from HTTP 305.
            The upstream server responded with <strong>{{statusCode}} {{statusText}}</strong>.
        </p>

        <div class="upstream-url">
            <span class="label">Upstream URL</span>
            {{url}}
        </div>

        <a href="/" class="home-btn">302 Me Home</a>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Status 305: Use Proxy &bull; Status {{statusCode}}: Upstream said no</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
